    <briefdescription>
<para>USB Switch control class for managing devices operations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides methods to control a usb switch module, including setting the output value for each output, the usb switch module has two output available: USB_OUTPUT1 and USB_OUTPUT2 toggling the output state, checking the status of the output, and setting the output value as a percentage.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="attention"><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>If using the grove connector, the yellow wire will control USB_OUTPUT1 and the white wire will control USB_OUTPUT2. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
